==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{affix|la|mūs|t1=mouse|-culus|pos2=diminutive suffix}}, or literally “little mouse”. The “muscle” sense is a {{semantic loan|la|grc|μῦς||mouse; muscle|nocap=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|mūsculus}}

===Noun===
{{la-noun|mūsculus|mūsculī|m|second}}

# small [[mouse]]
# {{lb|la|anatomy}} [[muscle]]
# saltwater [[mussel]]
# {{lb|la|military}} [[mantelet]], [[shielding]]

====Declension====
{{la-decl-2nd|mūscul}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|la|mūsculāris}}
* {{l|la|mūsculōsus}}

